OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FWet
OL,6,Fconditions continuing into the evening
OL,7,Fand overnight, with heavier downpours
OL,8,Fover the hills. Some drier interludes
OL,9,Fat times, with fog in places. Winds
OL,10,Fgradually strengthening in the north.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FPatchy cloud and rain to
OL,13,Fbegin, clearing slowly southwards
OL,14,Fthrough the day. Generally turning
OL,15,Fdrier and brighter, with sunny spells
OL,16,Fin cumbria. Breezy and feeling chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
