OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBrighter
OL,6,Fand colder weather into Friday with
OL,7,Fplenty of sunshine and widespread
OL,8,Ffrosts forming overnight. Becoming
OL,9,Fcloudier into Saturday, with a chance
OL,10,Fof rain into Sunday.
